"torej uporabljate :ref:'Transform Tool ' na vašem <transform_tool>:"
"ref:'transformation_masks', bi morali videti različne ključne okvire vsakega "
"kanala, ki se gibljejo v pogledu grafa, da bi odražali spremembe."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_curves.rst:110
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Animating a Transform Mask spawns a lot of channels but, depending on your "
"goals, you may only want to work with a small number of them at a time. "
"*Hiding* and *soloing* channels in the channels list can make it much easier "
"to see and edit curves, especially since you can use the :guilabel:`zoom to "
"channel` and :guilabel:`zoom to curve` buttons at the top of the docker to "
"fit the graph view to the currently visible channels."
msgstr ""
"Animiranje transform maske se razmnoževanje veliko kanalov, vendar, odvisno "
"od vaših ciljev, boste morda želeli delati le z majhnim številom njih "
"naenkrat. *Skrivanje* in *soloing* kanali na seznamu kanalov lahko veliko "
"olajšajo prikaz in urejanje krivul, še posebej, ker lahko uporabite :"
"guilabel:'zoom to channel' in :guilabel:'zoom to curve' gumbi na vrhu "
"dockerja, da se prilagodi pogled grafa na trenutno vidne kanale."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_curves.rst:112
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Navigating by click-dragging on the zoomable scrollbars and *values header* "
"(on the left-hand side of the graph view) can also really help with editing "
"curves!"
msgstr ""
"Krmarjenje z vlečenjem klikov po povečavi drsnih trakov in *glava vrednosti* "
"(na levi strani pogleda grafa) lahko prav tako resnično pomaga pri urejanju "
"krivul!"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_curves.rst:114
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Finally, click or scrub to a different frame time, add another keyframe, and "
"use the Transform Tool on the same Transform Mask again."
msgstr ""
"Na koncu kliknite ali izbrišite drug čas okvirja, dodajte še en ključni "
"okvir in znova uporabite Orodje za preoblikovanje na isti Transform Maski."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/animation_curves.rst:116
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Press the :guilabel:`play button` and (after a little bit of caching) there "
